# A confirm over the preset's dialog (sf presenters.mbt scrim_owner, recede_look): 删除 asks 删除预设？ over it, then
# back closes the confirm. MBUI_FIXTURE=newchat-preset-edit; a phone's window (MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=2) or, with
# MBUI_WIN=1280x800 MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=0, a wide one (back is Escape there too).
timeout 20000
until 名字
wait 800
tap 删除
wait 1000
back
wait 1000
exit
